[ Step 2: Column Header Standardization ]
   • Strip whitespace from header strings
   • Apply Regular Expressions to map CamelCase and special characters to snake_case
         │
         ▼
[ Step 3: Categorical Cleaning & Type Casting ]
   • Isolate text features using modern dtypes selection
   • Strip leading/trailing whitespaces from text fields
   • Cast categorical variables explicitly to PyArrow string dtypes
   • Convert numeric fields to int64 and float64
         │
         ▼
[ Step 4: Business Logic & Mathematical Validation ]
   • Verify Primary Key (customer_id) uniqueness and null counts
   • Bounded age verification (18 to 100)
   • Check non-negativity for tenure, monthly charges, total charges, and support tickets
   • Mathematical check: Total Charges == Monthly Charges * Tenure Months (atol=0.01)
         │
         ▼
[ Step 5: Data Quality Reporting & Export ]
   • Print Final Data Quality Audit Log
   • Export audit-ready dataset as customer_churn_clean.csv (index=False)
