Environment Requirements & Setup
To execute this pipeline without deprecation warnings, ensure your environment matches the following tooling requirements:  
Python Version: 3.10 or newer
Pandas: Version 2.0+ or 3.0+ (supports PyArrow string handling and updated dtype filtering)  
NumPy: Version 1.24+ (provides floating-point tolerance utilities)  
Jupyter Notebook / Lab: Compatible with modern Jupyter kernels  
Deliverables & Output Files
customer_churn_clean.csv: Sanitized, type-enforced, and validated output dataset ready for analytics, dashboarding, or model training.  
Data Quality Audit Log: In-memory summary printed at the conclusion of execution to confirm data integrity.
